        "TileImage": "$($repository 254b0a18-2601-43b6-98ba-fbe77c69db4c).Image",
        "Description": "Good afternoon Agent 47\r\rYour targets are Penelope Graves and her team of 4 hackers that our client calls &quot;The Hand&quot;. A group of elite hackers responsible for billions in stole funds and billions of dollars in damage from cyber attacks. The group made it&apos;s first and last mistake which has allowed our client to track them to a remote militia camp in Colorado. The client wants to make sure that this particular group can no longer get it&apos;s hands on whatever it wants. The clock is ticking Agent 47.",
